 longer adds two copies of an object.\n- Exploded view: Push together puts every part back in its own place. Parts you took out return with the first press, and at 0 % the object is exactly as it was, even after physics moved its parts.\n- Objects open up by a similar distance in the exploded view.\n- The full model library (4.4 GB) now installs with the app.\n\nCHANGED\n- For Quest 3 and Quest 3S.\n\nSTILL HERE\n- Take parts out of the exploded view by hand, Tracer trails, menus that tilt to face you.\n\nModels: SimReady Assets, CC BY 4.0, modified. Not endorsed by NVIDIA.", "created_date": 1793493185, "id": "1410803802115639", "version": "1.0.18", "version_code": 118, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 4}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1403638822832137", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1410803802115639"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2416214928916043"}]}, "change_log": "1.0.16: same app as 1.0.15; four asset files objects-1..4.pak attached as REQUIRED", "created_date": 1793485865, "id": "1410635668799119", "version": "1.0.16", "version_code": 116, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 4}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1403638822832137", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1410803802115639"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes"